WEBVTT

00:00:00.275 --> 00:00:02.587
Vox Studio is a voice studio that runs on

00:00:02.587 --> 00:00:04.938
your own computer. Nothing you type leaves

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:05.825
it.

00:00:06.425 --> 00:00:08.600
Pick a voice, or blend a few into a new

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.725
one. This narrator is sixty percent Heart

00:00:11.725 --> 00:00:13.825
and forty percent Emma.

00:00:14.512 --> 00:00:16.899
Fix how names are said: Pragyan rolled out

00:00:16.899 --> 00:00:19.737
of the lander while ISRO held its breath.

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:22.624
Then write your script in blocks, give

00:00:22.624 --> 00:00:24.649
each one a voice, and export the audio

00:00:24.649 --> 00:00:26.162
with captions.

